// Grand Integration & Benchmark Gate for Month 7 (Sprint 13 - Sprint 14):
// Proving direct 1:1 architectural, mathematical, and functional parity with:
// 1. Java 25 java.util.* (Collections, Concurrency, Math, Time, NIO)
// 2. Python 3.15 standard library (itertools, functools, statistics, pathlib, csv, argparse)
